sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant JobAPI
  participant PostgreSQL
  participant Scheduler
  participant Redis
  participant Worker

  Client->>JobAPI: POST /jobs
  JobAPI->>PostgreSQL: BEGIN (single transaction)
  JobAPI->>PostgreSQL: insert job status pending
  JobAPI->>PostgreSQL: insert dispatch_outbox row
  JobAPI->>PostgreSQL: insert job_event submitted
  JobAPI->>PostgreSQL: COMMIT
  JobAPI-->>Client: 202 with job_id and status_url

  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: read pending dispatch_outbox
  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: BEGIN (single transaction)
  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: transition job pending to queued
  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: mark outbox published
  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: COMMIT
  Scheduler->>Redis: LPUSH job_id to priority list

  Worker->>Redis: BRPOP job_id
  Worker->>PostgreSQL: conditional UPDATE claim queued to running, attempts + 1, set lease
  loop while running
    Worker->>PostgreSQL: heartbeat extends lease
    Worker->>PostgreSQL: check cancellation_requested_at
  end
  Worker->>PostgreSQL: BEGIN (single transaction)
  Worker->>PostgreSQL: mark job succeeded
  Worker->>PostgreSQL: insert notification_outbox row
  Worker->>PostgreSQL: COMMIT

  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: read notification_outbox
  Scheduler->>Scheduler: deliver log or webhook
  Scheduler->>PostgreSQL: mark notification sent

  Client->>JobAPI: GET /jobs/{id}
  JobAPI-->>Client: current status
